"overview":"THE IDOLM@STER follows 13 girls from the 765 Production Studio, whose sole goals is to become the top idols in the Japanese entertainment industry. Along with the laughs, struggles and tears that are inherently part of this journey, you will cheer for the girls of iDOLM@STER as they climb their way to the top!"},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"アイドルマスター","overview":"人気ゲーム「アイドルマスター」が待望のTVアニメ化。都内某所にある芸能事務所『765プロダクション』。その『765プロダクション』に所属する、天海春香をはじめとした個性豊かな13人の女の子たち。それぞれの夢に向かって頑張る彼女たちの活躍と成長を描いた物語。夢は大きく、めざせトップアイドル!!"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gSr6HH18G6x4Wzl3hNYToYaQiA5.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gSr6HH18G6x4Wzl3hNYToYaQiA5.png","language":"en","width":500,"height":62},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e7Lf4okAfsMJyhjlH3nHc0sUnHt.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e7Lf4okAfsMJyhjlH3nHc0sUnHt.png","language":"ja","width":486,"height":92}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Apjxs1eRlp2H4WZHQoDXktXd76.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6Apjxs1eRlp2H4WZHQoDXktXd76.jpg","language":"ja","width":1456,"height":2184},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q8f6reeyLpnH7EJG870phf4uJBx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q8f6reeyLpnH7EJG870phf4uJBx.jpg","language":"ja","width":830,"height":1245},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iEw5STC9TzDxML9PORJ73iiU6Z3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iEw5STC9TzDxML9PORJ73iiU6Z3.jpg","language":"ja","width":1000,"height":1426},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kYzUoMtOglBKkVaEEamU5MLSZGl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kYzUoMtOglBKkVaEEamU5MLSZGl.jpg","language":"xx","width":680,"height":1020},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/DXu7T2UmyAAA5KMvsFGhnR8cX4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/DXu7T2UmyAAA5KMvsFGh